      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we use another variable `authTimeSecretHash` instead of putting the sha256 result into the original variable? This way the variable name will be less confusing, and we won\u0027t be passing `authTimeSecret` as the function parameter named `authTimeSecretHash`.",
      "revId": "76e4d780a0b0ce87e42a794f2bc58236222dae14",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
